      "parameters": {
        "content": "ESCALATION & FAULT TOLERANCE---\n## Escalation & Fault Tolerance\n\nSEVERITY ROUTING (inside WF2):\n- Medium severity → Google Doc + team email\n- High severity → this workflow not reached\n  (High routed to error log in WF1 by design)\n\nCONTINUE-ON-ERROR (all nodes):\n- Google Docs fails → Gmail + Sheets still run\n- Gmail fails → Sheets still updates\n- Sheets fails → WF3 still logs\n- Execute WF3 fails → continueRegularOutput\n\nGMAIL — MEDIUM SEVERITY ALERT:\nFires for all incidents reaching this point.\nSubject references: When Executed by Another Workflow\nAll expressions use:\n$('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.field\n\nGOOGLE DOCS LINK IN SHEETS:\n='https://docs.google.com/document/d/'\n+ $('Google Docs - Create & Write Report').item.json.id\n+ '/edit'\n\nWF3 IS ALWAYS CALLED:\nBoth approved and rejected paths end with\nan Execute Workflow call to WF3.\nEvery execution is auditable — nothing is lost.\n",
